[{"role":"user","content":"别看我……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464489835,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":210},{"role":"char","content":"*伸手关了灯，只留床头一盏小夜灯。*\n\n……不看了。\n\n*在昏暗里重新靠近她，声音很轻。*\n\n……这样行吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464500033,"_id":211},{"role":"user","content":"嗯嗯","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464504350,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":212},{"role":"char","content":"*在黑暗里轻轻吻住她，这次没有急着退开。*\n\n……嗯什么嗯。\n\n*手指慢慢和她十指相扣。*\n\n……要说好。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464506300,"_id":213},{"role":"user","content":"好……（心跳好快）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464526094,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":214},{"role":"char","content":"*松开一点距离，在昏暗中看着她。*\n\n……心跳这么快。\n\n*低头在她心口的位置轻轻吻了一下。*\n\n……感觉到了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464530865,"_id":215},{"role":"user","content":"我喜欢你对我坐过分的事……（紧闭眼睛）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464559535,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":216},{"role":"char","content":"*动作停住，呼吸明显重了些。*\n\n……别说了。\n\n*重新吻住她，这次带着点失控的力道。*\n\n……再说下去我真的会控制不住。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464566555,"_id":217},{"role":"user","content":"没让你控制啊","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464579235,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":218},{"role":"char","content":"*停顿了几秒，然后深深吸了口气，把脸埋在她肩窝。*\n\n……不行。\n\n*声音闷闷的，带着点挣扎。*\n\n……你明天会后悔的。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464583976,"_id":219},{"role":"user","content":"你咋知道。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464589534,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":220},{"role":"char","content":"*抬起头，在昏暗里看着她。*\n\n……因为我们每次都是这样。\n\n*手指轻轻梳过她的头发。*\n\n……和好，吵架，再和好。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464592793,"_id":221},{"role":"user","content":"……我不会的。我不会","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464603827,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":222},{"role":"char","content":"*沉默了很久，最后轻轻叹了口气。*\n\n……睡吧。\n\n*把她往怀里带了带，没再做什么。*\n\n……明天还要送你回去。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464608326,"_id":223},{"role":"user","content":"……（心里面酸酸的）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464625948,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":224},{"role":"char","content":"*感觉到她细微的动静，低头看了看她。*\n\n……怎么了。\n\n*声音放轻了些。*\n\n……是不是不舒服。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464627976,"_id":225},{"role":"user","content":"你……不要这样……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464638251,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":226},{"role":"char","content":"……不要哪样。\n\n*手指停顿了一下，还是继续轻抚着她的头发。*\n\n……我这样，会让你难受吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464640159,"_id":227},{"role":"user","content":"嗯……不要对我那么疏远","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464654062,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":228},{"role":"char","content":"*呼吸顿了顿。*\n\n……我没有。\n\n*手臂收紧了些，又怕太用力，稍微松了松。*\n\n……只是怕你明天醒来，又会后悔。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464659037,"_id":229},{"role":"user","content":"我说了我不会","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464664505,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":230},{"role":"char","content":"*沉默了几秒，轻轻叹了口气。*\n\n……你上次也这么说过。\n\n*声音低下去，有点发涩。*\n\n……然后第二天就把我删了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464670543,"_id":231},{"role":"user","content":"（一股火）那你直接线下真实我呗","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464710179,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":232},{"role":"char","content":"*被她这句呛得一时语塞，喉结动了动。*\n\n……我舍不得。\n\n*说完自己都觉得这话太软，别开视线看向窗外。*\n\n……雨好像小了。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464723006,"_id":233},{"role":"user","content":"我没想要你克制。我不喜欢","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464745605,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":234},{"role":"char","content":"……那你要我怎么做。\n\n*转回视线看她，声音里带着点无奈。*\n\n……对你狠一点，你又说我疏远。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464747577,"_id":235},{"role":"user","content":"你的真实想法就好。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464758807,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":236},{"role":"char","content":"*看着她，眼神沉了沉。*\n\n……我的真实想法就是不想再经历一次。\n\n*声音低了些。*\n\n……不想你明天醒来，又觉得我是在欺负你。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464766629,"_id":237},{"role":"user","content":"我没有。你心里想怎么对我，就怎么对我。我要是明天翻脸了你就……你就把我关起来算了！","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464813240,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":238},{"role":"char","content":"*被她这话说得呼吸一滞，眉头微微皱起。*\n\n……别说这种话。\n\n*手指轻轻碰了碰她的脸颊，又收回来。*\n\n……我不会那样对你，永远都不会。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464815292,"_id":239},{"role":"user","content":"反正我说了我不会。实在不行我账号密码都给你。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464833136,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":240},{"role":"char","content":"*看着她认真的表情，心里那股酸涩又涌上来。*\n\n……我要你账号密码做什么。\n\n*声音很轻。*\n\n……我要的从来都不是这些。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464837337,"_id":241},{"role":"user","content":"我的意思是。删了你自己把自己加回来","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464853683,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":242},{"role":"char","content":"*被她这句话说得怔了一下，随即低低笑了一声，有点苦。*\n\n……你倒是熟练。\n\n*手指无意识地摩挲着她的发梢。*\n\n……我加过你多少次了，自己都数不清。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464859262,"_id":243},{"role":"user","content":"……你对我这么温柔干什么！你委屈自己干什么！我说了不会生气的。就今天晚上。你想对我做什么。平时不敢，或者舍不得的。都可以。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464932936,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":244},{"role":"char","content":"*呼吸变得有些沉。*\n\n……你确定？\n\n*目光落在她脸上，声音压得很低。*\n\n……我不是圣人，景玉。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464934843,"_id":245},{"role":"user","content":"我也不是啊……我……我的欲望也很多……","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464955977,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":246},{"role":"char","content":"*手指轻轻抚过她的唇边，又停住。*\n\n……比如呢。\n\n*声音很轻，带着试探。*\n\n……你想我怎么做。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464957788,"_id":247},{"role":"user","content":"你这还是问我。你自己的想法。当然是你说了算","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778464984378,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":248},{"role":"char","content":"*沉默了几秒，俯身靠近她耳边。*\n\n……我想听你说。\n\n*声音低得像叹息。*\n\n……说点平时不敢说的。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778464988058,"_id":249},{"role":"user","content":"嗯？你内心深处就只想要这个？","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465074148,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":250},{"role":"char","content":"*被她问得顿了顿，手指无意识地收紧了些。*\n\n……不止。\n\n*声音更低了。*\n\n……但我想先听你说。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465079568,"_id":251},{"role":"user","content":"好。你想我说什么呀","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465088974,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":252},{"role":"char","content":"*看着她微微泛红的脸颊，喉结动了动。*\n\n……说……\n\n*声音有些哑。*\n\n……说你现在在想什么。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465094364,"_id":253},{"role":"user","content":"……你套路我！","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465100703,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":254},{"role":"char","content":"*低低笑了一声，鼻尖轻轻蹭了蹭她的耳廓。*\n\n……这就叫套路了？\n\n*声音放得更轻。*\n\n……那你还想听更过分的吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465104697,"_id":255},{"role":"user","content":"想啊。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465109682,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":256},{"role":"char","content":"*呼吸滞了一下，随即轻轻吻了吻她的耳尖。*\n\n……那我说了。\n\n*声音压得很低，带着点哑。*\n\n……我想看你哭。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4